  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Disaster Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Founded by Chef Jose Andres, World Central Kitchen (WCK) is first to the frontlines providing fresh meals in response to crises. Climate crisis-fueled extreme weather leads to most of the disasters to which we respond. WCK launched our Climate Disaster Fund so we have the resources to activate immediately and support affected communities with food, water, and other needs. WCK responds to climate disasters including hurricanes, monsoon rains, cyclones, and wildfires.</narrative>
  </description>
